    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7619" root="حرز" body-key="H">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احترز</span></b>  <i>He prepared himself; he was,</i> or
<i>became, in a state of preparation.</i> (Msb in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حذر</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احترز مِنْهُ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">منه</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحرّز</span></b> , <i>He guarded
against it; was cautious of it;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَقَّاهُ</span>, (S,)
or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَقَّى مِنْهُ</span>, (K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَفَّظَ مِنْهُ</span>; (A, Msb;)
namely, a thing; (S, Msb;) or an enemy: (A:)
as though he put himself into a <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِرْز</span> to secure
himself therefrom. (TA.)

